cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenJev, please cite this project."
repository-code: "https://github.com/overfit-lab/OpenJev"
type: software
title: "OpenJev: Open Research for Typed Probabilistic Decisions"
authors:
  - name: "OpenJev contributors"
abstract: >-
  OpenJev studies typed probabilistic decisions through runtime-defined
  candidates, shared scalar scoring, probability supervision, and
  independent calibration. The repository provides the architecture
  and training plans for the project.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - decision models
  - probabilistic prediction
  - calibration
  - structured outputs
  - Qwen3
